/// SIT-only demo role. No hospital predicate — grants the soft-slicer path so a
/// demo operator can flip the Hospital slicer at demo time (design spec §7, H3
/// hybrid). Assignable only to HCC.DemoOperator and HCC.SuperAdmin in SIT.
/// PHI never reaches this role's queries: rows tagged PHI by the silver Gate 2
/// sweep are excluded, consistent with the other roles per ADR-0016 gate 4.
role SITDemoOperator
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission encounter = IF([_data_quality] = "phi", FALSE, TRUE)

	tablePermission bed_assignment = IF([_data_quality] = "phi", FALSE, TRUE)

	tablePermission fact_capacity_baseline = IF([_data_quality] = "phi", FALSE, TRUE)

	tablePermission or_case = IF([_data_quality] = "phi", FALSE, TRUE)

	tablePermission or_schedule = IF([_data_quality] = "phi", FALSE, TRUE)
